in Chat—it requires manual activation per session.\n- Agent sharing does not propagate Think mode settings; users must enable it independently.\n- Work’s automatic reasoning is not available in Chat and requires migration.\n\n> **Note**: Think mode is a legacy feature with no deprecation date, but Work’s reasoning system is the future direction [2].",
